        id: 'its-time-to-party-with-a-purpose',
        title: `It's time to Party with a Purpose!`,
        date: '2021-03-12',
        excerpt: `Please join us on Sunday, March 28 , for our second annual wine tasting at Aviary Wine & Kitchen. Our own BHE parent and Aviary co-owner, Marco Fiorilo, will present an "Understanding French Wine"…`,
        content: `Please join us on <strong>Sunday, March 28</strong>, for our second annual wine tasting at Aviary Wine &amp; Kitchen. Our own BHE parent and Aviary co-owner, Marco Fiorilo, will present an "Understanding French Wine" tasting, where he will take you through labels and regions so you can make educated purchases and find hidden gems at stores.

The event will be <strong>held outside on the Aviary patio</strong>, which can hold up to <strong>25 physically distanced</strong>. Tickets are <strong>$30</strong> and will include the tasting and a light cheese board. Wines will also be available for sale.

Proceeds will benefit the PTA, which means they benefit you! Please send <strong>$30</strong> via Venmo <strong>@BHEagles-PTA</strong> and <strong>mention "Wine" and your email address</strong>. Thank you!

<img class="size-medium wp-image-6597" src="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/pexels-arthur-brognoli-2440529-300x200.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="200" /> Photo by Arthur Brognoli from Pexels`,
