        id: 'carnival-silent-auction-sneak-peek-wells-solar',
        title: `Carnival Silent Auction Sneak Peek - Wells Solar`,
        date: '2017-10-13',
        excerpt: `Here is an Out of this World donation for our 2017 Carnival Silent Auction: Wells Solar & Electrical Services is offering an $11,000 3kW PV system designed for you! The first step before you bid on…`,
        content: `Here is an <strong>Out of this World</strong> donation for our 2017 Carnival Silent Auction:

<strong>Wells Solar &amp; Electrical Services</strong> is offering an<strong> $11,000 3kW PV system</strong> designed for you!

The first step before you bid on the solar system in the school auction is to see if solar will work for your home, what size system you can put on your roof and how much of your electric bill that system will offset your usage. To set up a <strong>free</strong> pre-qualification and solar assessment before the Carnival, please call <a href="tel:(512)%20382-7956">512.382.7956</a>.

Bidding will be available at the Carnival Silent Auction and will start at $4,500 with $150 minimum bid to raise. Happy Bidding!

<strong>Additional Details from Wells Solar &amp; Electrical Services:</strong>

This package may be used/applied towards a larger PV Solar system, granted the homeowner wishes to purchase additional panels to increase the power produced by the system.

Customer Design: Our team of NABCEP (North American Board of Certified Energy Practitioners) experts begins designing your custom solar energy system.

3.36 kW PV System: This package includes the following:
<ul>
 	<li>12 Mission 280W modules</li>
 	<li>12 Solar Optimizers P300</li>
 	<li>1 SolarEdge SE3000A-US Inverter</li>
</ul>
Sense Monitoring: This  equipment  allows  you  to  see the  real-time  power  production  of your  solar  panels  as  well  as  the real-time  energy  consumption  of your  home  through  a  web-based application.

Wells Solar is a local, family owned business in Austin, Texas. We started as a solar sub-contractor and for many years specialized in installing commercial and residential solar installations for regional companies. Because we've optimized the installation process we are able to offer very competitive pricing and an optimal customer experience to go through the entire process under one roof.

<a href="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/wells.png"><img class="alignleft size-medium wp-image-4646" src="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/wells-300x96.png" alt="" width="300" height="96" /></a>`,
