        content: `Lace up your running shoes, it's time for Marathon Kids!  Once again, BHE will be participating in Marathon Kids.  Read more here: <a href="http://bheeagles.com/marathon-kids/">Marathon Kids</a>

<a href="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/shoes.png"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-3858" src="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/shoes-300x231.png" alt="shoes" width="300" height="231" /></a>`,
