        content: `Hard to believe but school is just around the corner!  If you didn't get in on ordering pre-packaged school supplies online, no worries - there is plenty of time yet to get your supplies in order.

Bring your school supplies to Meet the Teacher (more details coming soon).

<a href="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/20160726125057696.pdf">2016-17 School Supply List</a>

<a href="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/school-supplies.png"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-3679" src="https://archive.bheeagles.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/school-supplies-300x217.png" alt="school-supplies" width="300" height="217" /></a>`,
